      "text": "This otherwise complete technical article contains implementation details, migration guidance, compatibility constraints, operational evidence, failure handling, and enough varied prose to satisfy the full text length threshold.",
      "expected": "insufficient_quality"
    },
    {
      "id": "low-confidence-extraction",
      "depth": "full_text",
